{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young boy named Aether (or something different, IDK this game is still in development)   who has to leave the quiet comfort of his quaint village to embark on a quest. You like what I did there with the alliterations? Moving on, Aether might seem like your average JRPG male protagonist, but not all is what it seems. His hair isn't a cluster of spikes and he doesn't need his mom to wake him up in the mornings. He doesn't want to help the local girl find her missing cat or show the mystery woman around at the Inciting Incident Fair. He doesn't even want to save the world!<i>\u00a0Audible gasps.</i> Yes, that's right. He just wants to live a normal life. Unfortunately for this world, he is the protagonist. Follow along Aether's journey as he is thrust forward into a world at constant peril while he looks for ways to dodge and evade his heroic duties and just return home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alas, he can't come home until he saves the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/de57c271d65dff148f372b0a4fbe1f88.avif?t=1763098691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras_big/de57c271d65dff148f372b0a4fbe1f88.avif?t=1763098691 width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/28c3136efb4755203bbf3f3d63509170.avif?t=1763098691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras_big/28c3136efb4755203bbf3f3d63509170.avif?t=1763098691 width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_